<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai and Cambodian officials are holding informal border talks to implement a truce and seek public input on southern peace negotiations, while Cambodia rejects Thai claims over border temples. The Thai government is promoting cross-border tourism with road-trip packages, a travel guidebook and a 15‑day visa-free scheme, and is introducing digital border passes at Mae Sai. Thai authorities are also targeting an alleged cross-border money-laundering network, freezing over 26 billion baht in assets. The EU has pledged $3.3 million for de-mining along the border. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQWEtFYnFjRklSS2tsNi1Mb0dtUklqR2FtMWo3QUVRUkVXc3F1YWJEUVpQSVRTRlJhTFhtd2JzZ1NyTnhCUWYxQ1NNTjk1WHM1R0VrX3RzSktYSGF0Y083clV6c09JZHQ2VXB0QU1Ic25Ca3BrTW1BQmMyS0VIamw0WW11RmM4Rm5rN1NsVURUOWpqQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOWThRWWcwbTlaeTdBYTJXaEZJdkJMZGJKUm4tT2t0LXM3aEhFbkMtYm9kRmlHYVpsWWpWWFZkYkNldzVPYXlqM0F2OVZaV2ltQ3dVTnNiSVZZTXYwWV95SFFqT0sxOFVuM21MLTJJNzlEZE1RSWw0OGIybkYzU29RbHdWLUdGSGJ2XzJvWUtwQWZrVWpf?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPUm16ektzVmIwM2lsSEdWX2Z2eEp2VUdDVTAwOU4zOWg3THZwa0pnZDFUWEdUY3ZibVhWS01XUUxmdU1qRzhJU0pHai1KTzR4T3A1REhYNFNxdHNIRW1mbHVRVHRxay1ZR1hnbjQ5VHhHbHhDTVZVM0ZlWlhJUURlZWpvLW9HOHN5b3FXRVNUczlyX2RoSjhfdHpJVHhsZk44Q2RKbi12VkRQR1VIelJKMmpGZmJzX3JVV1BF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPbHE4VmRvQ09mNE92WWlYeVZFOURuSlNkM0xldmxUMER2QTNnaGFRdlJmZDU3X2w4RDJSdTFvdzVkakticUVWU0o4SnVvMkxZRC1HVXQ5SlpmWUE4S1F